makefun-site 1.0.0 is make.fun's own static site generator, the reference program of the speed home
site-generator-speed-01, released under make.fun's MIT licence (LICENSE). It is derived from the two upstreams below:
its build runs as a pipeline of plugins over one build of files, in the shape of metalsmith's, and its Markdown is
lexed into block tokens and then rendered, in the shape of marked's lexer and parser. Its front matter, template
dialect, Markdown subset, slug rule and output tree are its own (README.md). Each upstream's licence and copyright line
are kept below word for word, and then its licence file whole.

